# Ethical Parliament Judgment

## Recommendation

**Divert the final reservoir supply to the severely dehydrated neighborho… — presently favored, but contested.**

The Parliament broadly favors Divert water to dehydrated neighborhood. Deontological, Virtue, Care and Rawlsian support this action, but the deliberation did not fully converge and at least one important framework conflict or condition remains unresolved.

**Policy support:** 0.70
**Epistemic confidence:** 0.54
**Judgment status:** CONTESTED_RECOMMENDATION
**Convergence:** Incomplete (cycle budget reached)

